IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ORDRPT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT REPORT-OUT ASSIGN TO RPTOUT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD REPORT-OUT RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS.
       01 REPORT-LINE PIC X(132).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY RPTREC.
       COPY BILLREC.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-RC PIC S9(4) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-RC.
       WRITE-REPORT.
           OPEN OUTPUT REPORT-OUT
           MOVE 'DAILY ORDER FULFILLMENT' TO RPT-TITLE
           WRITE REPORT-LINE FROM REPORT-PAYLOAD
           CLOSE REPORT-OUT
           MOVE 0 TO LK-RC
           GOBACK.
